OL,3,GNEWSATributes to 'dedicated' former
OL,4,AManx politician
OL,5,
OL,6,FTributes have been paid to the
OL,7,F"dedication and commitment" of former
OL,8,FIsle of Man politician George Waft, who
OL,9,Fhas died at the age of 89.
OL,11,FAfter serving on Onchan Commissioners
OL,12,Ffor two decades, Mr Waft served in both
OL,13,Fthe House of Keys and the Legislative
OL,14,FCouncil in a national political career
OL,15,Fthat spanned further 19 years.
OL,17,FAlthough he retired from politics in
OL,18,F2010, he remained active in the Onchan
OL,19,Fcommunity, serving as president of the
OL,20,Fvillage's Royal British Legion (RBL)
OL,21,Fbranch.
OL,23,APub: 01-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
